# =====================================================================
# VoltRescue - Free Cloud Database Configuration (.env)
# =====================================================================
# Note: VoltRescue works 100% out-of-the-box with ZERO configuration using
# the free browser-native Geolocation, Leaflet OpenStreetMap, and
# BroadcastChannel cross-tab persistence.
#
# If you want to connect a free cloud backend across different physical
# devices without running your own server, choose either Supabase or Firebase below:

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 1: Supabase (Free Tier: 500 MB DB + Realtime WebSockets)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Create a free account at https://supabase.com
# 2. Create a project and grab your Project URL and Anon API Key from Settings -> API
# 3. Uncomment the lines below:
# VITE_DB_PROVIDER=supabase
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxxxxxxxx.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 2: Firebase Realtime Database (Spark Free Plan)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Create a free project at https://console.firebase.google.com
# 2. Build -> Realtime Database -> Create Database (Start in test mode)
# 3. Uncomment and paste your database URL below:
# VITE_DB_PROVIDER=firebase
# VITE_FIREBASE_DB_URL=https://your-project-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com
